assertions: PMG-CX-006, PMG-CX-012
proves: The verdict document is byte-identical between packages and byte-stable across invocations, so what a dispatcher relays cannot differ from the artifact; and the OPEN-PR terminal opens exactly one PR through kermit on a clean verdict, opens none on a failing one, never merges, and never reaches gh silently.
